    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aims to improve the efficiency of The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) staff and the quality and safety of care delivered to patients through the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution." ;
