    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) proposes a solution that integrates with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) information system and electronic patient record, supporting health interoperability standards such as HL7 FHIR, the national health identifier INS, and the national framework Ségur du Numérique en Santé, Mon Espace Santé, DMP. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution is designed to assist hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, facilitating access to information, improving the quality of written outputs, and reducing processing and documentation times. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution provides an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting clinical and administrative activities. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution must fit into existing practices of staff and not introduce rupture in clinical or administrative workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

